source_proof = "The declared pytest module parses the actual template with the production Python YAML loader, checks its complete schema, executes every documented example through the real Python verifier, checks true and false captured RESULT values, and asserts Go YAML tags, capture storage, verifier dispatch, boolean and arithmetic implementation facts and matching committed Go cases."
