baseline = "No pre-change verification was run: the explicit implementation-first order and hf-build-before-hf-done sequence prohibit running verify_cmd by hand, superseding the older unchanged-tree baseline clause. No baseline failures are claimed. Initial Git status/diff showed only runner-prepared .cgignore and spec status bookkeeping, no scoped changes; gate.json showed zero builds/verifies and no gates.jsonl existed."
